        "raw": "[quote=\"cajunjoel\"]\n\nSo have at it. We may continue to tweak how the quotes appear as time goes on, but that&#39;s a definite bonus.--Joel\n\n[/quote]\n\nThought I&#39;d give this a try to see how it worked. I&#39;m <em>especially</em> interested in how the use of BBCode within the [i]formatted[/i] text will work. I&#39;d tried a post earlier with the <strong>URL</strong> [b]BBCode[/b] tag that failed, so I&#39;m going to give it a try, here.\n\n<a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/\">Here&#39;s a normal link</a> and [url=http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/]here&#39;s a BBCode link[/url].\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Results</strong>:&nbsp;It ignored the bold (&quot;[[b]b]&quot; /&nbsp;&quot;[[/b]/b]&quot;)&nbsp;and italicized (&quot;[[i]i]&quot; / &quot;[[/i]/i]&quot;) BBCodes and displays the url codes without processing (which is what I experienced in my earlier post).\n",
