        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d6d6ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-10T02:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll try this again now that we've made some changes…</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">This should be bold using bbcode</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.google.com\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">This should be a link to google.com</a></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-i\">And this should be italics</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Finally, as a note, any prior non-working BBcode is working somewhat better. Except those few that have GIGANTIC sizing on them. The old boards uses different measurements for sizing of fonts. I still need to search/replace to fix those. (or the owner can edit and fix them on their own)</p>\n<p>–Joel</p>",
