        "raw": "I&#39;ll try this again now that we&#39;ve made some changes...\n\n[b]This should be bold using bbcode[/b]\n\n[url=http://www.google.com]This should be a link to google.com[/url]\n\n[i]And this should be italics[/i]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nFinally, as a note, any prior non-working BBcode is working somewhat better. Except those few that have GIGANTIC sizing on them. The old boards uses different measurements for sizing of fonts. I still need to search/replace to fix those. (or the owner can edit and fix them on their own)\n\n--Joel\n",
